  <span class="section-label">The journey</span>
  <h2>Seven stages of a trip</h2>
  <p class="lead">Click a stage to jump to it. Each stage lists when it starts, the steps in order, the Tasks Tern adds, what runs automatically, the templates and forms to use, and what needs Barbara’s go-ahead.</p>
  <nav class="journey" aria-label="Trip stages">
    <a href="#stage-1"><span class="num">1</span>Inquiry<small>Inbound</small></a>
    <a href="#stage-2"><span class="num">2</span>Discovery<small>Agreement &amp; fee</small></a>
    <a href="#stage-3"><span class="num">3</span>Proposal<small>Planning</small></a>
    <a href="#stage-4"><span class="num">4</span>Booking<small>Booked</small></a>
    <a href="#stage-5"><span class="num">5</span>Pre-trip<small>T-180 → T-1</small></a>
    <a href="#stage-6"><span class="num">6</span>Traveling<small>Traveling</small></a>
    <a href="#stage-7"><span class="num">7</span>Post-trip<small>Traveled</small></a>
  </nav>

  <div class="paths" role="group" aria-label="Show steps for">
    <span>Show steps for:</span>
    <button type="button" data-path="all" aria-pressed="true">Every trip type</button>
    <button type="button" data-path="custom" aria-pressed="false">Custom / FIT</button>
    <button type="button" data-path="hotel" aria-pressed="false">Hotel only</button>
    <button type="button" data-path="cruise" aria-pressed="false">Cruise</button>
  </div>
  <p class="lead">Steps tagged “All trips” always show. Ticking a Task box only marks it on this page for you; it doesn’t change anything in Tern and resets when the page reloads.</p>

  <span class="section-label">Step by step</span>
  <div class="toolbar"><button type="button" data-act="open">Expand all</button><button type="button" data-act="close">Collapse all</button></div>
  <div id="stages"><details class="stage" id="stage-1"><summary><span class="num">1</span><span class="st">Inquiry &amp; lead</span></summary><div class="sbody"><div class="block "><h4>Starts when</h4><p>A new inquiry comes in and a Contact is created. Client Care | Important Dates applies itself to every new Contact (birthday, anniversary and passport reminders). Trip Status, if a trip is opened: <b>Inbound</b>.</p></div><div class="block "><h4>Do this</h4><ol class="steps"><li data-path="all">Apply <b>Lead Task List (Contact basis)</b> to the Contact. It doesn’t apply itself.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">Reply to the inquiry with template <b>01. Introduction to my services</b>, which includes Barbara’s booking link for the intro call.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">If the request isn’t a fit, use the decline or budget templates below — Barbara decides which.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">If the lead goes quiet after the intro call, send <b>03. Check in following intro call</b>.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ol></div><div class="block "><h4>Tasks that appear in Tern</h4><ul class="check"><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Lead | Reply to inbound lead</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Lead (Contact)</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Email templates to send by hand</h4><ul class="tl"><li data-path="all"><span><b>01. Introduction to my services (lead)</b> — “Trip Planning Service Introduction”</span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>03. Check in following intro call</b> — “Following up on your trip plans”</span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>04. Decline Trip Request</b> — “Your upcoming travel plans”<div class="sub">No capacity</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>05. Decline Activity Only</b> — “Your request for assistance with trip activities”<div class="sub">Activity-only requests</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>06. Vetting Budget &amp; DIY</b> — “My Travel Services and your upcoming trip”<div class="sub">Sets budget expectations</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>07.a Holiday Season Travels Budget</b> — “Holiday Season Travels”<div class="sub">Peak holiday budgets</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ul></div><div class="block flag"><h4>Check with Barbara</h4><ul class="plain"><li>Whether to take the trip, and which decline or budget template to use.</li></ul></div></div></details><details class="stage" id="stage-2"><summary><span class="num">2</span><span class="st">Discovery &amp; engagement</span></summary><div class="sbody"><div class="block "><h4>Starts when</h4><p>Barbara has had the intro call and the client wants to move ahead. Once a trip exists, it can carry the trip version of the lead list.</p></div><div class="block "><h4>Do this</h4><ol class="steps"><li data-path="all">Send the recap with <b>02a. Introduction to my travel services (recap post intro call)</b>.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">Send the agreement with <b>02b. Client Agreement Email</b>. It links the Agency Client Agreement form. Share the Authorization form if a card is needed.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">If you’re working on the trip rather than the Contact, apply <b>Lead Task List (Trip basis)</b>.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">When the planning fee is paid, send <b>02c. Planning Fee Payment Confirmation</b>. It links the Client Profile form. The matching automation is Inactive, so this is sent by hand.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">Barbara moves the Trip Status to <b>Planning</b> (or approves the change).<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ol></div><div class="block "><h4>Tasks that appear in Tern</h4><ul class="check"><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Lead | Send client recap email</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Lead (Trip), Lead (Contact)</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Lead | Send Client agreement &amp; fee invoice</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Lead (Trip)</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Lead | Upon payment of fee, updates status to Planning</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Lead (Trip)</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Lead | Client Consult</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Lead (Contact)</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Lead | Send Client Agreement &amp; cc authorization</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Lead (Contact)</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Runs automatically</h4><p class="sub">Grey rows are Inactive: they sit on the trip but won’t send until Barbara personalizes and activates them.</p><div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>What</th><th>Path</th><th>Workflow</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-path="custom" class="is-off"><td class="when">1 day after status → Planning</td><td>✉ Payment Received – Let’s Get Started!<div class="sub">To: Primary Contact</div><div class="sub">▤ links Client Profile</div></td><td><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></td><td class="wfc">Trips | Planning <span class="pill off">Inactive</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="block "><h4>Email templates to send by hand</h4><ul class="tl"><li data-path="all"><span><b>02a. Introduction to my travel services (recap post intro call)</b> — “Your vacation”</span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>02b. Client Agreement Email</b> — “Next Steps to Planning Your Vacation” <span class="sub">▤ Agency Client Agreement</span></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>02c. Planning Fee Payment Confirmation</b> — “Payment Received – Let’s Get Started!” <span class="sub">▤ Client Profile</span></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Forms</h4><ul class="plain"><li>▤ <b>Agency Client Agreement</b> — terms, professional fees and e-signature</li><li>▤ <b>Authorization</b> — credit card authorization, shared by hand</li><li>▤ <b>Client Profile</b> — traveler details, loyalty numbers, special needs and interests</li></ul></div><div class="block flag"><h4>Check with Barbara</h4><ul class="plain"><li>Trip Status changes always go through Barbara.</li></ul></div></div></details><details class="stage" id="stage-3"><summary><span class="num">3</span><span class="st">Research &amp; proposal</span></summary><div class="sbody"><div class="block "><h4>Starts when</h4><p>Trip Status is <b>Planning</b> (custom trips) or <b>Hotel Only</b> (hotel-only bookings). For hotel-only trips, the Hotel Only Workflow applies itself.</p></div><div class="block "><h4>Do this</h4><ol class="steps"><li data-path="custom">Apply <b>Trips | Planning</b> to the trip. It doesn’t apply itself.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom">Work the proposal Tasks in order: suppliers/DMC, flights, hotels, activities, transportation, then the proposal and follow-ups.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom">Three days after the status changes, the Travel Insurance email sends on its own and creates a follow-up Task to chase the reply or quote.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="all">If the client doesn’t answer about insurance, send <b>15b</b> with the Travel Insurance Acknowledgement form.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">If the itinerary approval isn’t signed, send <b>14</b> with the Itinerary Approval form.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="hotel">Research the hotel and request availability (template <b>20. Hotel Request</b>).<span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li></ol></div><div class="block "><h4>Tasks that appear in Tern</h4><ul class="check"><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Contact DMC / Preferred Suppliers</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Add Flight proposal</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Hotel proposal - options submitted, client to make selections</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Activities - options submitted, client to make selections</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Transportation: trains/planes/car rental/transfers</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Proposal Follow-Up #1 &amp; 2 or activities/car/trains</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Create &amp; Send Client Proposal AXUS / Email or Lodging options and flight options</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Proposal Updates (if necessary)</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Initial Planning — DMC, Flights, Hotels, Activities, Transfers</b><span class="sub"> · 4 days after applied · Myself · from FIT | Planning to Booked</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Client Proposal</b><span class="sub"> · 4 days after applied · Myself · from FIT | Planning to Booked</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="hotel"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Hotel | Research</b><span class="sub"> · 7 days after applied · Myself · from Hotel Only</span></span></label><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="hotel"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Hotel | Request Availability (if necessary)</b><span class="sub"> · 7 days after applied · Myself · from Hotel Only</span></span></label><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>VA: Create pricing details in Tern</b><span class="sub"> · 12 days after applied · Virtual Admin · from FIT | Planning to Booked</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Runs automatically</h4><p class="sub">Grey rows are Inactive: they sit on the trip but won’t send until Barbara personalizes and activates them.</p><div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>What</th><th>Path</th><th>Workflow</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-path="custom" class=""><td class="when">3 days after status → Planning</td><td>✉ The Importance of Travel Insurance + follow-up task<div class="sub">To: Primary Contact</div></td><td><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></td><td class="wfc">Trips | Planning <span class="pill on">Active</span></td></tr><tr data-path="custom" class="is-off"><td class="when">7 days after status → Planning</td><td>✉ What&#x27;s the next step? Enter Tern–Trip Central<div class="sub">To: Primary Contact</div></td><td><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></td><td class="wfc">Trips | Planning <span class="pill off">Inactive</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="block "><h4>Email templates to send by hand</h4><ul class="tl"><li data-path="custom"><span><b>08. One Price Itinerary</b> — “Trip Pricing”<div class="sub">Explains single-price itineraries</div></span><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>15a. Travel insurance template</b> — “The Importance of Travel Insurance”</span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>15c. Travel Insurance existing clients</b> — “Would you like a travel insurance quote for your trip?”<div class="sub">Returning clients</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>15d. Travel Insurance for Canadian Clients</b> — “Travel Insurance”<div class="sub">Canadian clients</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>15b. Travel insurance disclaimer when no reply</b> — “Declining Travel Insurance” <span class="sub">▤ Travel Insurance Acknowledgement</span></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>14. Itinerary Approval Disclaimer when no response</b> — “Finalizing your trip approval” <span class="sub">▤ Itinerary Approval &amp; Travel Insurance Acknowledgement</span></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="hotel"><span><b>20. Hotel Request</b> — “Availability Request”<div class="sub">To the hotel, not the client</div></span><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="custom"><span><b>Quote In Progress - Create a Tern Account</b> — “What&#x27;s the next step? Enter Tern–Trip Central”<div class="sub">Saved for future use; its automation is Inactive</div></span><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Forms</h4><ul class="plain"><li>▤ <b>Travel Insurance Acknowledgement</b> — client confirms insurance was offered</li><li>▤ <b>Itinerary Approval &amp; Travel Insurance Acknowledgement</b> — client approves the itinerary</li><li>▤ <b>Travel Insurance Decline Waiver</b> — not linked to any email; share by hand if Barbara asks</li></ul></div><div class="block flag"><h4>Check with Barbara</h4><ul class="plain"><li>FIT | Planning to Booked has its own planning Tasks (including the VA pricing Task). Confirm with Barbara whether a trip gets that Workflow or Trips | Planning, so Tasks aren’t doubled.</li></ul></div></div></details><details class="stage" id="stage-4"><summary><span class="num">4</span><span class="st">Booking &amp; payments</span></summary><div class="sbody"><div class="block "><h4>Starts when</h4><p>The client approves and Barbara moves the Trip Status to <b>Booked</b>. Booked | Trip Status and Payment Reminders apply themselves. For premium, luxury or river cruises, adding the <b>Prem/Lux River</b> tag applies Premium/Lux Cruise BOOKED Workflow MC. Adding the <b>concierge</b> tag to a hotel-only trip is how the Concierge Tasks are meant to arrive (Auto-Apply is off on that Workflow, so it may need applying by hand).</p></div><div class="block "><h4>Do this</h4><ol class="steps"><li data-path="custom">Finish the Trips | Planning booking Tasks: confirm bookings with suppliers, add trip tags, and add the pre/post-travel Workflow.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom">If Barbara uses FIT | Planning to Booked, apply it now (Auto-Apply is off). Its Travel Insurance email sends two days after Booked.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="all">Send confirmations: <b>10. Flight Confirmations</b>, <b>11. Hotel Only Booking Confirmation Note</b> or the cruise line’s deposit email.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all">Payment Reminders adds a Task to switch on its reminders. The reminder emails are Inactive until Barbara activates them; until then, use the payment templates below.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="cruise">Mass-market cruises: apply <b>Mass Market Cruise BOOKED Workflow MC</b> by hand. Premium/luxury/river: add the Prem/Lux River tag.<span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise">Send the deposit-paid email for that cruise line, note medical, dietary, mobility needs and celebrations with the cruise line, and send the final-payment email once paid in full.<span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="hotel">The “Thank you for booking your hotel” email sends as soon as the status is Hotel Only.<span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="hotel">Send the hotel a VIP request (<b>21. VIP Request</b>).<span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li></ol></div><div class="block "><h4>Tasks that appear in Tern</h4><ul class="check"><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Send Final Payment Email (when paid in full)</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Mass Market Cruise MC, Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Upon Itin Approval, update status to Booked + Add Trip Tags (if used)</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Confirm booking(s) with Supplier(s)</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Planning | Add Pre / Post Travel Workflow</b><span class="sub"> · no due date · Myself · from Trips | Planning</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Send deposit paid email</b><span class="sub"> · At apply · Myself · from Mass Market Cruise MC, Premium/Lux Cruise MC</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>VA: Double check automations! Inactive/active and due dates.</b><span class="sub"> · At apply · Virtual Admin · from Mass Market Cruise MC</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>EDIT and ACTIVATE Initial Insurance Quote Automation</b><span class="sub"> · At apply · Myself · from Mass Market Cruise MC</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Move trip to Booked Status if you haven&#x27;t already.</b><span class="sub"> · At apply · Myself · from Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Double check your automations! Inactive/active and due dates.</b><span class="sub"> · At apply · Myself · from Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Send cruise line specific deposit paid email</b><span class="sub"> · At apply · Myself · from WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Confirm medical/ dietary/ mobility concerns and/or special occasions</b><span class="sub"> · 1 day after applied · Myself · from Mass Market Cruise MC</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="all"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Activate payment reminders to send to client</b><span class="sub"> · 2 days after applied · Myself · from Payment Reminders</span></span></label><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="hotel"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Hotel | Review &amp; personalize automations</b><span class="sub"> · 3 days after applied · Myself · from Hotel Only</span></span></label><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>VA: Update Bon Voyage automation with destination-specific email</b><span class="sub"> · 4 days after applied · Myself · from Mass Market Cruise MC</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Have you noted specific needs / events with the Cruise Line?</b><span class="sub"> · 5 days after applied · Myself · from Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="custom"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Trip Approved: Confirm with Supplier(s) &amp; pay deposits</b><span class="sub"> · 12 days after applied · Myself · from FIT | Planning to Booked</span></span></label><span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Runs automatically</h4><p class="sub">G