</li><li data-path="all"><span><b>10 days before payment due</b> — “Upcoming payment for your trip”<div class="sub">Manual payment reminder</div></span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>1 day BEFORE payment due</b> — “Upcoming payment for your trip”</span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="all"><span><b>1 day AFTER payment due</b> — “Your payment is overdue”</span><span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ul></div><div class="block "><h4>Forms</h4><ul class="plain"><li>▤ <b>Hotel Reservation Confirmation</b> — client confirms they reviewed hotel confirmations; not linked to an email, share by hand</li><li>▤ <b>Authorization</b> — card details for supplier payments</li></ul></div><div class="block flag"><h4>Check with Barbara</h4><ul class="plain"><li>Activating payment reminders and the cruise “Initial Insurance Quote” email (Inactive in both MC Workflows).</li><li>Which cruise Workflow to use: the Prem/Lux River tag applies the original MC version, not the WWT version.</li></ul></div></div></details><details class="stage" id="stage-5"><summary><span class="num">5</span><span class="st">Pre-trip</span></summary><div class="sbody"><div class="block "><h4>Starts when</h4><p>The trip is Booked and the departure date is set. Most automations in this stage count back from the trip start date (T-180 to T-5).</p></div><div class="block "><h4>Do this</h4><ol class="steps"><li data-path="all">Around 45 days out, send <b>16. 45-Day Check-In & Profile Refresh</b> (Passport Info & Emergency Contact form) if no automation covers it.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li><li data-path="custom">At T-30, personalize the pre-trip automated emails and prepare final documents and VIP letters.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="custom">Send the final itinerary with <b>12. Final Itinerary (AXUS)</b>, plus <b>DNS 13. How to Use / Access AXUS</b>.<span class="tag custom">Custom / FIT</span></li><li data-path="cruise">Create the AXUS itinerary (T-45), check amenities on the reservation (T-35), and update the Bon Voyage email with destination details (T-55).<span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="hotel">Send the VIP letter to the hotel (T-16).<span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="all">Bon Voyage emails go out 5–7 days before departure; most are Inactive until personalized.<span class="tag all">All trips</span></li></ol></div><div class="block "><h4>Tasks that appear in Tern</h4><ul class="check"><li data-path="hotel"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Concierge | Transfers</b><span class="sub"> · 7 days after applied · Myself · from Concierge</span></span></label><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="hotel"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Concierge | Restaurants</b><span class="sub"> · 7 days after applied · Myself · from Concierge</span></span></label><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="hotel"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Concierge | Onsite Activities (Spa / Services)</b><span class="sub"> · 7 days after applied · Myself · from Concierge</span></span></label><span class="tag hotel">Hotel only</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>EDIT and ACTIVATE Insurance before Final Payment Automation</b><span class="sub"> · T-135 · Myself · from Mass Market Cruise MC, Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Update Bon Voyage automation with destination-specific email</b><span class="sub"> · T-55 · Myself · from Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></span></label><span class="tag cruise">Cruise</span></li><li data-path="cruise"><label><input type="checkbox"> <span><b>Create AXUS</b><span class="sub"> · T-45 · Myself · from Premium/Lux Cruise MC, WWT Premium/Lux Cruise</span></s